{"api_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/39309","collected_at":"2026-09-27T21:56:45.130620+00:00","comments":[],"issue":{"active_lock_reason":null,"assignee":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14262417?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yashk2810","id":14262417,"login":"yashk2810","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MjYyNDE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810","user_view_type":"public"},"assignees":[{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14262417?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yashk2810","id":14262417,"login":"yashk2810","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MjYyNDE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810","user_view_type":"public"}],"author_association":"NONE","body":"### Description\n\nThis is reproducible on JAX 0.11.0 with an Explicit `(data=1, tensor=4)` mesh on TPU v6e-4, but not on JAX 0.10.2. A singleton reshape drops the size-1 `data` mesh axis in 0.11.0, and the resulting symbolic sharding is\nrejected by a downstream `concatenate` even though the device mapping is physically unchanged.\n\nMinimal reproducer:\n\n```python\nimport numpy as np\n\nimport jax\nimport jax.numpy as jnp\nfrom jax.sharding import AxisType, Mesh, NamedSharding\nfrom jax.sharding import PartitionSpec as P\n\ndevices = np.asarray(jax.devices()[:4]).reshape(1, 4)\nmesh = Mesh(\n    devices,\n    (\"data\", \"tensor\"),\n    axis_types=(AxisType.Explicit, AxisType.Explicit),\n)\n\nmatrix_sharding = NamedSharding(mesh, P(\"data\", \"tensor\"))\nexpected_3d_sharding = NamedSharding(mesh, P(\"data\", \"tensor\", None))\n\n@jax.jit\ndef reshape_to_heads(x):\n    return x.reshape(-1, 4, 128)\n\nwith jax.set_mesh(mesh):\n    x = jax.device_put(np.ones((1, 512), np.float32), matrix_sharding)\n    y = reshape_to_heads(x)\n    expected = jax.sharding.reshard(y, expected_3d_sharding)\n    empty_tail = y[..., :0]\n\n    print(\"reshape:   \", y.sharding)\n    print(\"empty tail:\", empty_tail.sharding)\n    jnp.concatenate((expected, empty_tail), axis=-1)\n```\n\nOn JAX 0.10.2:\n\n```text\nreshape:    P('data', 'tensor', None)\nempty tail: P('data', 'tensor', None)\nconcatenate succeeds\n```\n\nOn JAX 0.11.0:\n\n```text\nreshape:    P(None, 'tensor', None)\nempty tail: P(None, 'tensor', None)\n\nShardingTypeError: All operands should have the same sharding.\nGot P('data', 'tensor', None) and P(None, 'tensor', None)\n```\n\nThe `reshard` is physically a no-op because `mesh['data'] == 1`; it models\nanother computation branch whose output type still contains the explicit\n`data` axis. Resharding the 2-D input immediately before `reshape` does not\nhelp because 0.11.0 drops `data` again during the reshape. Resharding after\nthe reshape is a workaround.\n\n\n### System info (python version, jaxlib version, accelerator, etc.)\n\n\n```text\njax:    0.11.0\njaxlib: 0.11.0\nnumpy:  2.2.6\npython: 3.13.14\ndevice info: TPU v6 lite-4, 4 local devices\nprocess_count: 1\nplatform: Linux x86_64\n```","closed_at":"2026-07-20T18:39:58Z","closed_by":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/44061?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/copybara-service%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/copybara-service%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/copybara-service%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/copybara-service%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/copybara-service","id":56741989,"login":"copybara-service[bot]","node_id":"MDM6Qm90NTY3NDE5ODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/copybara-service%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/copybara-service%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/copybara-service%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/copybara-service%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/copybara-service%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/copybara-service%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments":0,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/39309/comments","created_at":"2026-07-20T08:59:32Z","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/39309/events","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/39309","id":4927373974,"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"total_blocking":0},"issue_field_values":[],"labels":[{"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null,"color":"d73a4a","default":tr